OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader aims to keep
OL,4,Afootball club in Prescot
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnowsley Council wants to ensure
OL,7,FPrescot Cables' future but does not
OL,8,Fhave the money to pay for a new stand
OL,9,Fat the ground the local authority has
OL,10,Fowned since 2018, its leader has told
OL,11,Fthe BBC.
OL,13,FWhile the historic non-league side may
OL,14,Fnot be the most famous football club on
OL,15,FMerseyside, Cables can claim to be
OL,16,Folder than neighbouring Liverpool FC.
OL,18,FHowever, its fans are worried the club
OL,19,Fmay have to relocate from its Valerie
OL,20,FPark home because the main stand is
OL,21,F"nearing the end of its life".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
